    repl('compliance/index.html', '<h3>Governance &amp; Independent Challenge</h3><p>DApps Platform USA maintains a dedicated Board governance structure for its U.S. operating organization. The DApps Platform USA Board provides strategic oversight, executive accountability, escalation, and independent challenge for material U.S. business matters. DApps Platform Inc. remains the underlying legal entity for applicable corporate, contracting, and employment obligations.</p>', '<h3>U.S. Governance &amp; Authorized Operations</h3><p>DApps Platform USA is the U.S. market-facing business brand and operating designation of DApps Platform Inc. for Company-authorized U.S. activities. Governance, risk, compliance, escalation, and oversight processes for those activities operate under DApps Platform Inc. authority. Where a DApps Platform USA Board is referenced in executive or governance materials, it is an internal U.S. oversight arrangement and does not constitute the board of a separate DApps Platform USA legal entity.</p><p>Corporate structure and authorization details, including California Entity / File Number 4190391 (C4190391), are available on the <a href="/company-verification/">Company Verification</a> page.</p>')
    repl('leadership/index.html', '<div class="eyebrow">DApps PLATFORM USA BOARD</div><h2>Dedicated governance for the U.S. organization.</h2><p>DApps Platform USA maintains a dedicated Board governance structure for the U.S. operating organization. The DApps Platform USA Board provides strategic oversight, executive accountability, independent challenge, escalation, and governance of material U.S. business matters. Certain U.S. executive positions report directly to the DApps Platform USA Board according to their mandate and governance responsibilities.</p><p>DApps Platform Inc. remains the underlying legal entity for applicable employment, contracting, and corporate obligations; the DApps Platform USA Board is the governance body for the U.S. operating organization.</p>', '<div class="eyebrow">U.S. GOVERNANCE &amp; OVERSIGHT</div><h2>Internal governance for U.S. market operations.</h2><p>DApps Platform USA is the Company-authorized U.S. market-facing business and operating designation of DApps Platform Inc. Where a DApps Platform USA Board is referenced in executive or governance materials, it functions as an internal U.S. governance and oversight body under Company authority and is not the board of a separately incorporated DApps Platform USA entity.</p><p>Certain U.S. executive positions may report to the DApps Platform USA Board under applicable internal governance arrangements, while DApps Platform Inc. remains the legal employer and contracting entity for applicable agreements.</p>')
