    repl('privacy/index.html', '<h2>Company References</h2><p>References to DApps Platform USA on this website describe the U.S. operating organization of DApps Platform Inc. This naming distinction does not change the privacy practices described below.</p>', '<h2>Company References</h2><p>References to DApps Platform USA on this website identify the U.S. market-facing business and operating designation of DApps Platform Inc. This designation does not create a separate legal entity or, by itself, identify a separate data controller, and it does not change the privacy practices described below.</p>')
    repl('trust-wallet/index.html', 'A transparent summary of current public-source ecosystem context and the U.S. operating structure presented on this website.', 'A transparent summary of current public-source ecosystem context and the Company authorization governing DApps Platform USA U.S. market activities.')
    repl('trust-wallet/index.html', '<h2>How DApps Platform USA is structured</h2><p>DApps Platform USA operates as an independently governed U.S. operating organization, with its own U.S. leadership structure, Board oversight, operating responsibilities, and decision-making framework.</p><p>DApps Platform Inc. serves as the underlying legal entity for applicable employment, contracting, and corporate obligations. DApps Platform USA maintains its own U.S. governance structure, including the DApps Platform USA Board, which provides oversight of the U.S. organization and its executive leadership.</p><p>This structure distinguishes the legal entity responsible for applicable corporate and employment obligations from the U.S. operating and governance organization through which U.S. leadership and business activities are conducted. References on this page to other DApps Platform-named entities in the Trust Wallet ecosystem are presented as public-source context and do not, by themselves, establish additional ownership, agency, licensing, or legal-identity relationships with DApps Platform USA.</p>', '<h2>How DApps Platform USA is authorized</h2><p><strong>DApps Platform USA</strong> is the Company-authorized U.S. market-facing business brand, trade name, and operating designation of <strong>DApps Platform Inc.</strong> for United States market activities. It is not a separate legal entity unless separately incorporated or expressly designated in a written Company instrument.</p><p>The signed Corporate Authorization also permits DApps Platform USA, for legitimate Company-authorized U.S. market activities, to reference and use Trust Wallet trademarks, product names, logos, service names, and approved brand assets subject to applicable brand guidelines and any trademark ownership, licensing, or usage requirements. The authorization does not transfer ownership of Trust Wallet or other intellectual property to DApps Platform USA.</p><p>References on this page to other DApps Platform-named entities remain public-source ecosystem context and do not, by themselves, establish that those entities are the same legal entity or establish additional ownership, agency, licensing, or legal-identity relationships. <a href="/documents/dapps-platform-inc-corporate-authorization-dapps-platform-usa.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the signed Corporate Authorization (PDF) →</a></p>')
    repl('contact/index.html', 'DApps Platform is developing its U.S. organization and operating capabilities. Public information is limited to statements appropriate for external disclosure at the current stage.', 'DApps Platform Inc. conducts and develops U.S. market activities under the DApps Platform USA business designation. Corporate verification and authorization information is available on the Company Verification page.')
    repl('Vice-President-of-Sales-DApps-Platform-USA/index.html', 'DApps Platform USA is the independently governed U.S. operating organization of DApps Platform Inc., with dedicated U.S. leadership and Board oversight. The organization is building its commercial, operating, technology, and governance capabilities in Los Angeles for its next stage of growth.', 'DApps Platform USA is the U.S. market-facing business and operating designation of DApps Platform Inc. for Company-authorized U.S. activities. The U.S. commercial, operating, technology, and governance capabilities supporting this role are being built in Los Angeles.')
